67-df-godel-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ba0adc4f8f4a1bbd\" href=\"?note=ba0adc4f8f4a1bbd\" title=\"67-df-translation\">67-df-translation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"55353aba49d6b3f2\" href=\"?note=55353aba49d6b3f2\" title=\"67-df-primitive-recursive\">67-df-primitive-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a329235da6144513\" href=\"?note=a329235da6144513\" title=\"67-df-strong-godel-encoding\">67-df-strong-godel-encoding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"第 6 章 §1，印刷页 75–76；PDF 第 86–87 页"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本轮核对形式陈述、类型、变量绑定和册内依赖；未重新核验原书 PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"inherited_source_proof_status","html":"不适用（定义）"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"input_verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"input_source_proof_status","html":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"revision_status","html":"locally-revised"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(S,T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Int}(S,T,\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{Int}(S,T,\\tau)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" href=\"?note=44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" title=\"67-df-interpretability\">67-df-interpretability</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:\\mathrm{Expr}_{L_A}\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N\">\\(g:\\mathrm{Expr}_{L_A}\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N\\)</span>，满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e5654af7c954e1c0\" href=\"?note=e5654af7c954e1c0\" title=\"67-df-godel-encoding\">67-df-godel-encoding</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GN}_{L_A}(g)\">\\(\\mathrm{GN}_{L_A}(g)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_{L_A}^{\\mathrm{fm}}\">\\(g_{L_A}^{\\mathrm{fm}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{decF}_{L_A,g}\">\\(\\operatorname{decF}_{L_A,g}\\)</span> 取同一条目。额外要求公式代码集可原始递归判定，公式构造、代入及 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"ba0adc4f8f4a1bbd\" href=\"?note=ba0adc4f8f4a1bbd\" title=\"67-df-translation\">67-df-translation</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\">\\(\\nu\\)</span> 在代码上的总化均为原始递归；数值化解码条件为下式定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CanF}_g\\in\\mathrm{PR}_1\">\\(\\operatorname{CanF}_g\\in\\mathrm{PR}_1\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\unlhd_{\\mathrm{pr},g}\">\\(\\unlhd_{\\mathrm{pr},g}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\unlhd_{\\mathrm{pr}}\">\\(\\unlhd_{\\mathrm{pr}}\\)</span> 为下式定义的关系；下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{pr}\">\\(\\mathrm{pr}\\)</span> 是原始递归性的固定标识。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{PR}_1\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"55353aba49d6b3f2\" href=\"?note=55353aba49d6b3f2\" title=\"67-df-primitive-recursive\">67-df-primitive-recursive</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\tau_g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\widehat\\tau_g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 在下式总化，非法公式代码取值为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau:\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}\">\\(\\tau:\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\tau_g\">\\(\\widehat\\tau_g\\)</span> 先解码为公式，再应用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>，最后使用公式编号。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_{L_A}\">\\(c_{L_A}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{in}_{1,L_A}\">\\(\\mathrm{in}_{1,L_A}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"a329235da6144513\" href=\"?note=a329235da6144513\" title=\"67-df-strong-godel-encoding\">67-df-strong-godel-encoding</a> 的规范编号与公式标签嵌入。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CanF}_g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\operatorname{CanF}_g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 将合法 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span>-公式码变为规范公式码，非法码取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>；不将返回公式树的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{decF}_{L_A,g}\">\\(\\operatorname{decF}_{L_A,g}\\)</span> 直接放进自然数函数类。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CanF}_g(n)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\nc_{L_A}\\!\\left(\\mathrm{in}_{1,L_A}(\\operatorname{decF}_{L_A,g}(n))\\right),&amp;\nn\\in g_{L_A}^{\\mathrm{fm}}[\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}],\\\\\n0,&amp;n\\notin g_{L_A}^{\\mathrm{fm}}[\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}].\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{CanF}_g(n)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\nc_{L_A}\\!\\left(\\mathrm{in}_{1,L_A}(\\operatorname{decF}_{L_A,g}(n))\\right),&amp;\nn\\in g_{L_A}^{\\mathrm{fm}}[\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}],\\\\\n0,&amp;n\\notin g_{L_A}^{\\mathrm{fm}}[\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}].\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\tau_g(n)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\ng_{L_A}^{\\mathrm{fm}}\\!\\left(\\tau(\\operatorname{decF}_{L_A,g}(n))\\right),&amp;n\\in g_{L_A}^{\\mathrm{fm}}[\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}],\\\\\n0,&amp;n\\notin g_{L_A}^{\\mathrm{fm}}[\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}].\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\tau_g(n)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\ng_{L_A}^{\\mathrm{fm}}\\!\\left(\\tau(\\operatorname{decF}_{L_A,g}(n))\\right),&amp;n\\in g_{L_A}^{\\mathrm{fm}}[\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}],\\\\\n0,&amp;n\\notin g_{L_A}^{\\mathrm{fm}}[\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}].\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S\\unlhd_{\\mathrm{pr},g}T\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists\\tau\\ (\\mathrm{Int}(S,T,\\tau)\\land\\widehat\\tau_g\\in\\mathrm{PR}_1),\n\\qquad\nS\\unlhd_{\\mathrm{pr}}T\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ S\\unlhd_{\\mathrm{pr},g}T.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S\\unlhd_{\\mathrm{pr},g}T\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists\\tau\\ (\\mathrm{Int}(S,T,\\tau)\\land\\widehat\\tau_g\\in\\mathrm{PR}_1),\n\\qquad\nS\\unlhd_{\\mathrm{pr}}T\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ S\\unlhd_{\\mathrm{pr},g}T.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本节保留的原书页码、既往核对记录及证明说明来自输入档案；本次未提供原书 PDF，以下既往记录不表示本次重新完成了来源或证明核验。</p>\n<p>保留旧接口，补出编号参数和非法代码上的值。单射编码保证第一分支的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 唯一；公式逆函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{decF}_{L_A,g}:g_{L_A}^{\\mathrm{fm}}[\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}]\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}\">\\(\\operatorname{decF}_{L_A,g}:g_{L_A}^{\\mathrm{fm}}[\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}]\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}\\)</span> 的使用不让分支条件中的存在量词逸出作用域；两个分支覆盖全部自然数且互斥。</p>\n<p>原书没有把原始递归性另立为更强的解释概念：其第 75–76 页规定的每个翻译在标准编码下已经原始递归。因此在本文件额外明确的编码条件下，这个条件不缩小原书的可解释性关系；旧稿“严格加强普通可解释性”的说明已撤去。来源陈述已核对，未制作形式化递归程序。</p>\n<p>来源：Per Lindström, <em>Aspects of Incompleteness</em>，原档案所引 PDF；第 6 章 §1，印刷页 75–76；PDF 第 86–87 页。</p>\n<p>证明核验范围：不适用（定义）。</p>\n<p>代码变换的中间对象是公式树而非带标签表达式。原始递归性要求作用于自然数到自然数的总函数；非法公式码分支仍取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-interpretability","status":"resolved","id":"44cd21d3d12e4d8d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-interpretability]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-godel-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"e5654af7c954e1c0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-godel-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-translation","status":"resolved","id":"ba0adc4f8f4a1bbd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-translation]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"55353aba49d6b3f2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-primitive-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-strong-godel-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"a329235da6144513","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-strong-godel-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-interpretability","status":"resolved","id":"44cd21d3d12e4d8d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S,T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}$、$\\mathrm{Int}(S,T,\\tau)$ 取 [[67-df-interpretability]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-godel-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"e5654af7c954e1c0","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $g:\\mathrm{Expr}_{L_A}\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N$，满足 [[67-df-godel-encoding]] 的 $\\mathrm{GN}_{L_A}(g)$；$g_{L_A}^{\\mathrm{fm}}$、$\\operatorname{decF}_{L_A,g}$ 取同一条目。额外要求公式代码集可原始递归判定，公式构造、代入及 [[67-df-translation]] 的 $\\nu$ 在代码上的总化均为原始递归；数值化解码条件为下式定义的 $\\operatorname{CanF}_g\\in\\mathrm{PR}_1$。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-translation","status":"resolved","id":"ba0adc4f8f4a1bbd","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $g:\\mathrm{Expr}_{L_A}\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N$，满足 [[67-df-godel-encoding]] 的 $\\mathrm{GN}_{L_A}(g)$；$g_{L_A}^{\\mathrm{fm}}$、$\\operatorname{decF}_{L_A,g}$ 取同一条目。额外要求公式代码集可原始递归判定，公式构造、代入及 [[67-df-translation]] 的 $\\nu$ 在代码上的总化均为原始递归；数值化解码条件为下式定义的 $\\operatorname{CanF}_g\\in\\mathrm{PR}_1$。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"55353aba49d6b3f2","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PR}_1$ 取 [[67-df-primitive-recursive]]。$\\widehat\\tau_g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$ 在下式总化，非法公式代码取值为 $0$。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-strong-godel-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"a329235da6144513","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$c_{L_A}$、$\\mathrm{in}_{1,L_A}$ 使用 [[67-df-strong-godel-encoding]] 的规范编号与公式标签嵌入。$\\operatorname{CanF}_g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$ 将合法 $g$-公式码变为规范公式码，非法码取 $0$；不将返回公式树的 $\\operatorname{decF}_{L_A,g}$ 直接放进自然数函数类。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"S,T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Int}(S,T,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"g:\\mathrm{Expr}_{L_A}\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GN}_{L_A}(g)","display":false},{"tex":"g_{L_A}^{\\mathrm{fm}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{decF}_{L_A,g}","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CanF}_g\\in\\mathrm{PR}_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\unlhd_{\\mathrm{pr},g}","display":false},{"tex":"\\unlhd_{\\mathrm{pr}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{pr}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PR}_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat\\tau_g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau:\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\wideha